<details class="journey-panel reader-space"><summary>Founder review delivery · WhatsApp Business setup</summary><p>Email uses the existing configured mail transport. WhatsApp uses a separate Cloud API sender and a Meta-approved review template; a Facebook or Instagram login is not a WhatsApp sender.</p>
<p>Email: <?=email_transport_ready()?'Configured':'Needs configuration'?> · WhatsApp: <?=founder_story_whatsapp_ready()?'Configured; live delivery still needs verification':'Needs configuration'?></p>
<form method="post" action="<?=e(url('/write/founder-stories/whatsapp'))?>" class="journey-form"><?=csrf_field()?>
<div class="field"><label for="story-wa-phone">WhatsApp sender phone-number ID</label><input id="story-wa-phone" name="phone_id" inputmode="numeric" value="<?=e(setting('founder_story.whatsapp_phone_id',''))?>"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="story-wa-template">Approved template name</label><input id="story-wa-template" name="template" value="<?=e(setting('founder_story.whatsapp_template',''))?>"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="story-wa-language">Template language</label><input id="story-wa-language" name="language" value="<?=e(setting('founder_story.whatsapp_language','en'))?>"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="story-wa-token">Cloud API access token</label><input id="story-wa-token" type="password" name="access_token" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="<?=setting('founder_story.whatsapp_token','')?'Saved securely; leave blank to keep':'Enter through this secure form'?>"></div>
<label class="journey-check"><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" value="1" <?=setting('founder_story.whatsapp_enabled','0')==='1'?'checked':''?>><span>Enable the configured WhatsApp sender for explicitly requested founder reviews.</span></label><button class="wbtn" type="submit">Save delivery settings</button>
</form><p>Template body parameters, in order: founder name, story title, review round, private review URL. Suggested copy: “Hello {{1}}, please review {{2}} for Founder Stories (round {{3}} of 3). Open your private review: {{4}}. You may approve, propose edits or decline. The story will not be published without your approval.” Submit the template to Meta and use its approved name and language.</p><p><a href="https://business.facebook.com/wa/manage/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open WhatsApp Manager</a> · <a href="https://developers.facebook.com/documentation/business-messaging/whatsapp/templates/overview" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Meta template documentation</a></p>
</details>
